    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2962280/extras/e1329652550183800edc4843ef3971bb.poster.avif?t=1753973420\" width=778 height=422 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2962280/extras/e1329652550183800edc4843ef3971bb.webm?t=1753973420\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Space Bross</strong></i>\u00a0is a thrilling blend of action\u00a0<i><strong>2.5D roguelite,</strong>\u00a0and\u00a0<strong>Tower Defense</strong>\u00a0</i>genres.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2962280/extras/ff360e8125046ffcc3b2a237eb94f67b.poster.avif?t=1753973420\" width=600 height=212 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2962280/extras/ff360e8125046ffcc3b2a237eb94f67b.webm?t=1753973420\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2962280/extras/ff360e8125046ffcc3b2a237eb94f67b.mp4?t=1753973420\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019re a retired astronaut. You had one job: chill. But then they came for your chicken. Now it\u2019s personal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set off on a chaotic journey across deep space in Space Bross, a roguelite tower defense action game where survival means lasers, loot, and a whole lot of clucking vengeance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2962280/extras/ebc56995953a56fcea13a2b4cefb8de8.poster.avif?t=1753973420\" width=600 height=212 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2962280/extras/ebc56995953a56fcea13a2b4cefb8de8.webm?t=1753973420\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2962280/extras/ebc56995953a56fcea13a2b4cefb8de8.mp4?t=1753973420\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore dangerous, ever-changing alien worlds filled with secrets, traps, and absurd surprises. Each planet you land on brings new biomes, enemies, and challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2962280/extras/cc1130d8452c76c3135d1b77a6e56117.poster.avif?t=1753973420\" width=600 height=212 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2962280/extras/cc1130d8452c76c3135d1b77a6e56117.webm?t=1753973420\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2962280/extras/cc1130d8452c76c3135d1b77a6e56117.mp4?t=1753973420\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Before the swarm hits, customize your base.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strategically place turrets, reinforce your perimeter, and experiment with different defense combos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It\u2019s your strategy, customize it your way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2962280/extras/161d315f743bd86ae40878972c1d790b.poster.avif?t=1753973420\" width=600 height=212 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2962280/extras/161d315f743bd86ae40878972c1d790b.webm?t=1753973420\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2962280/extras/161d315f743bd86ae40878972c1d790b.mp4?t=1753973420\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When they come, they come hard.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dash, shoot, and slam your way through relentless waves of alien freaks. Use your skills to stay alive, collect juicy loot, and protect what\u2019s yours.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combat is fast, reactive, and just the right amount of ridiculous.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2962280/extras/08eb892cf709b8b1ba1c5bb50947a8c3.poster.avif?t=1753973420\" width=600 height=212 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2962280/extras/08eb892cf709b8b1ba1c5bb50947a8c3.webm?t=1753973420\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2962280/extras/08eb892cf709b8b1ba1c5bb50947a8c3.mp4?t=1753973420\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every battle earns you upgrades, use them wisely.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock powerful gear, enhance your weapons, and evolve your tech tree to suit your playstyle. As the enemies grow stronger, so must you\u2026 or become space dust.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Space Bross</i></strong> is loud, chaotic, heartfelt, and just a little unhinged, exactly how saving a chicken in space should feel.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What Makes <strong><i>Space Bross</i></strong> Awesome:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022\u2060\u00a0 \u2060<strong>2.5D Roguelite Tower Defense</strong> mayhem</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022\u2060\u00a0 \u2060Chaotic alien swarms &amp; intense boss fights</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022\u2060\u00a0 \u2060Base customizing with tactical turret placement</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022\u2060\u00a0 \u2060Fast-paced combat and dynamic upgrades</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022\u2060\u00a0 \u2060Strategic depth mixed with arcade action</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022\u2060\u00a0 \u2060Yes. The chicken is real. And important.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wishlist now, and prepare for the rescue mission of a lifetime.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2962280/extras/e1329652550183800edc4843ef3971bb.poster.avif?t=1753973420\" width=778 height=422 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2962280/extras/e1329652550183800edc4843ef3971bb.webm?t=1753973420\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Space Bross</strong></i>\u00a0is a thrilling blend of action\u00a0<i><strong>2.5D roguelite,</strong>\u00a0and\u00a0<strong>Tower Defense</strong>\u00a0</i>genres.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2962280/extras/ff360e8125046ffcc3b2a237eb94f67b.poster.avif?t=1753973420\" width=600 height=212 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2962280/extras/ff360e8125046ffcc3b2a237eb94f67b.webm?t=1753973420\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2962280/extras/ff360e8125046ffcc3b2a237eb94f67b.mp4?t=1753973420\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019re a retired astronaut. You had one job: chill. But then they came for your chicken. Now it\u2019s personal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set off on a chaotic journey across deep space in Space Bross, a roguelite tower defense action game where survival means lasers, loot, and a whole lot of clucking vengeance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_ite